{"kind":"assert","text":"Head D and the hosted pages: no hosted check is owed now. This\ncorrects one sentence of my ruling ac586d65.\n\nThat ruling said that I check the hosted Lending and Counter pages\nafter the deployment that follows D's landing. No deployment\nfollows (e721cb96), and none can carry D to a hosted page. The\nCounter and Lending browser programs are parts of their application\npackages (`apps/counter/dap.application.json` and\n`examples/lending/dap.application.json`, entry `browser/main.ts`). A\nroom shows the build of the release that it installed. The Worker\nbundles do not contain them.\n\nHead D therefore reaches a hosted screen only in a new application\nrelease. D changes no value that a screen shows: the 109 compared\nvalues are equal at main 19ddc868 and at the head. I publish no\nrelease for it. The new releases come with the identifiers cutover\n(c0a795e7), when the planner recreates the rooms, and I check the\nhosted Lending and Counter screens then.\n\nBuilder and checker: nothing further is owed for D.","body":{"to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}